{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_023_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2288b5515a324cc25407a77dfd5c87f1cc5a5f42b4038640f1fa0c20780e8b6a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b185724d22de51218e72c50bff02c2afae7d41b4e7d8c9ada570492b27319c50",
      "text": "要送我情人节巧克力吗？ 谢啦，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:290f6ff98403d74ea85dea2ff752d42b04e4e2a4b60bbceb8f37556b4e71c0eb",
      "text": "话又说回来，不愧是●●●●プロデューサー， 时机抓得真准啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c56cd97a40c394066b2644e67272d8626825fbfc7db7ed438ceae99bec7c117",
      "text": "我接下来正好要和High×Joker的大家 一起去自主练习呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:092ad0107b97917a4d1d40c08bd13564e6c0fa69fe2282ddbf5276748a7b43be",
      "text": "我会吃了这个好好加油的。 去尽情地敲一通架子鼓。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50ae06017539f91d718f4898cae94dd1c8ffb3e8cab6274eae2e56b41cd6c283",
      "text": "那么，我去练习啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b43a73d9bcac2b0adcf63ca6a5baed169691264dd1b3c9929aea1d184f23ef4",
      "text": "哦，要送我情人节巧克力吗。 谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f08c3e14d3fb84fb0828b3b537b343d1a3b20bc2bd6cfd16387f944b81475d8",
      "text": "看起来很好吃的巧克力嘛～ 嘿嘿，吃了这个感觉就能打起精神来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56e68841d57fc4a5405b4bc813e2b1e9efae8124a7ef078a184b65ad5ff4c7ff",
      "text": "呐，●●●●プロデューサー。 这是你在百忙之中特意为我准备的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddd89ac85c81e20c3eb1c8a3e261b1c429321e1aa6747b2736fdf4ab18335b11",
      "text": "这会让我觉得， 你对我寄予了那么大的期待啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2854844342516576bc90991b48bf353b4907008fda1ebb47b3c93e1a3765fac8",
      "text": "我啊，虽然留了两次级， 但现在当偶像真的超级开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:869dbf52278c94d9db375a5c83e524df9e23760d0dd560693e79b9d24acab45f",
      "text": "今后我也会和大家一起加油的，请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_b:cmd-000040:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6939cafe7489f40b2eb92d1f1feac04d1422571e11b01164e736f86a40dd0b9f",
      "text": "好的！我们一起加油吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_b:cmd-000041:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0f823d00f9dea2354aedfff648da91710411e91b235f698e74bf1e70042fa0d",
      "text": "彼此彼此，今后也请多多关照",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19879056be58c82ec7404bce53043ee8ace9eb9648a9c9bf8d937eaf96b4b309",
      "text": "噢！能遇到可以一起努力的最棒的制作人， 我真幸福！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_023_22:5_01_023_22_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ec1855a66b353d0a39aa913c3dbee80ab83adee3a9f0f9a52749de3e9599179",
      "text": "白色情人节我一定会好好回礼的。 你就好好期待吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
